    "pt": [
      "O Nove de Espadas fala de angústia, pesadelos e despertar.",
      "Ele representa a dor mental no meio da noite.",
      "O foco dele é: encarar a escuridão até ela se encher de luz."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Nine of Swords speaks of anguish, nightmares and awakening.",
      "It stands for mental pain in the middle of the night.",
      "Its focus: facing the dark until it fills with light."
    ]
